/* 支持性评估（Figma 657:1923）：自助整理卡（唯一实心按钮）→ 我的整理 → 真人支持性复核 → 页尾边界与求助入口。 */
.ta-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.ta-self {
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.ta-path {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-soft);
}

.ta-path__item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.ta-path__index {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.ta-path__text {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.ta-current-review {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-soft);
}

.ta-current-review__kicker {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.ta-section,
.ta-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.ta-row-button {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

/* 真人复核：纸白组块，暂未开放时只显示说明与状态标签 */
.ta-human {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 36rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.ta-human .p3-btn {
  align-self: stretch;
}

.ta-case {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.ta-case__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.ta-case__titles {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1 0 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.ta-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  column-gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.ta-candidate,
.ta-evidence__line {
  padding: 20rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

/* 反馈与线索：左侧青瓷竖线，与反馈信同一语言 */
.ta-spine,
.ta-evidence {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding-left: 28rpx;
  border-left: 4rpx solid var(--p3-primary);
}

.ta-spine__label {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.ta-spine__body,
.ta-evidence__main {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.ta-evidence__summary {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
}

.ta-withdraw {
  color: var(--p3-risk-ink);
}

.ta-short-input {
  height: auto;
  min-height: 96rpx;
}

.ta-scope-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.ta-scope {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  min-height: 88rpx;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.ta-policy {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: 36rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.ta-policy__toggle {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  text-align: left;
}

.ta-policy__title {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.ta-policy__action {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.ta-policy__row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding-top: 24rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.ta-policy__row .p3-btn {
  align-self: stretch;
}

.ta-policy__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  width: 100%;
}

.ta-policy__name {
  flex: 1 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.ta-policy__copy {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.ta-footer {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

/* “查看紧急求助资源 ›”：风险色文字链，上下补触控区 */
.ta-footer__link {
  align-self: flex-start;
  width: auto;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: -16rpx 0;
  padding: 16rpx 0;
  color: var(--p3-risk-ink);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  text-align: left;
}
